# Copy to .env (git-ignored) or export these in your shell.
# Nothing in this repository requires a key: every published table and figure
# regenerates from data/ alone. Keys are only needed to RE-FETCH from chain.

# Solana RPC + enhanced-transactions provider (https://helius.dev, free tier is
# enough). Comma-separated if you have several: the clients rotate round-robin
# and fail over on 429/5xx, which is what makes the deep history walks finish.
HELIUS_API_KEYS=

# Optional. Path to the raw, unpublished collector state. Only two things need
# it: rebuilding data/ from scratch (make_public_data.py) and the cross-check of
# T1 against the second, independent simulator.
# PUMP_PRIVATE_ROOT=/path/to/pump_bundle_detector
